{"id":"n71475-1-8","stage":3,"title":"턱 · 下巴","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71475-1-8-1","ko":"턱에 뭐 묻었어.","zh":"下巴上沾了东西哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"턱에","meaning":"下巴，下颌","explanation":"턱：下巴，下颌；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"턱","audio":"/audio/8786c15d3542589b8529.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71475","senseId":"1","lemma":"턱","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"턱에","audio":"/audio/5d2f255d6886a177039f.mp3"}},{"text":"뭐","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}},{"text":"묻었어.","meaning":"沾上","explanation":"묻다：沾上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"묻다","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"46165","senseId":"1","lemma":"묻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"묻었어","audio":"/audio/11591ba165d2538051bd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8786c15d3542589b","term":"턱","zh":"下巴，下颌","audio":"/audio/8786c15d3542589b8529.mp3","entryId":"71475","definition":"人脸嘴巴以下尖尖地凸出的部分。","pronunciation":["턱"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"沾上","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"46165","definition":"黏上灰尘、污垢、粉末或液体等。","pronunciation":["묻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/648457b3c9bd05a4c6d5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71475-1-8-2","ko":"에구, 아까 밥을 먹다가 묻은 모양이네.","zh":"哎呀，好像是刚才吃饭的时候沾上的吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"에구,","meaning":"哎哟","explanation":"에구：哎哟。","readings":[{"term":"에구","audio":"/audio/78adebf97be38f76ab4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67579","senseId":