897ec5.mp3","entryId":"65974","definition":"不久以前。","pronunciation":["아까"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"在大米或其他谷物中倒入水后煮干至熟的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"ed5c4f65f9f1771c","term":"묻다","zh":"沾上","audio":"/audio/ed5c4f65f9f1771c348e.mp3","entryId":"46165","definition":"黏上灰尘、污垢、粉末或液体等。","pronunciation":["묻따"]},{"id":"f1cd655a5837981f","term":"모양","zh":"情况，样子","audio":"/audio/f1cd655a5837981f96d3.mp3","entryId":"62397","definition":"某种状况或状态；或指事情的进展状况。","pronunciation":["모양"]}],"audio":"/audio/1f392056fac0eca695b7.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.87,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71475","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":102,"sequenceScore":2.6967,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["哎呀，好像是刚才吃饭的时候沾上的吧。","下巴上沾了东西哦。","您抱着宝宝要去哪儿啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["下巴上沾了东西哦。","您抱着宝宝要去哪儿啊？","哎呀，好像是刚才吃饭的时候沾上的吧。"],"answer":2}]}
